chip ym2608
clock 7987200
samples 12000
ssg-override
mem adpcm-a opna-rhythm.bin
fidelity min
# An SSG override on the YM2608: told of the prescale and reset as the chip
# is made, it takes the SSG writes and reads; prescale writes and a
# fidelity change tell it again; the SSG output stays 0 and FM and rhythm
# play on.
